        "original_id": "9fd290fb-88b9-5568-a97b-bc2281aeae42",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michel Foucault\n- Works: Biopower, The History of Sexuality, The Will to Knowledge, La volonté de savoir\n- Organizations: Collège de France\n- Topics: publication history, terminology\n\nFacts:\n- Michel Foucault first used the term Biopower in his lecture courses at the Collège de France.\n- Michel Foucault's term Biopower first appeared in print in The Will to Knowledge, the first volume of The History of Sexuality.\n- The first volume of The History of Sexuality, titled The Will to Knowledge (La volonté de savoir), was first published in 1976.\n- An English translation of The Will to Knowledge appeared in 1978.",
